{"reviewId": "17139892_81zixEkTp", "review": {"abstract": "造成资源需求的边际上升，而以前在资源品价格处于低位时供给没有得到充分准备，这带来供需边际变化短期内的不平衡，资源约束启动，价格迅速上升，这一点一旦与资本收益率的下降相契合就会发生经济冲击。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "通俗化解释:\n当一些原本不发达的国家开始工业化，对资源的需求慢慢增加，但之前资源价格低的时候，大家没怎么扩大生产准备，所以短时间内资源供应跟不上需求，导致资源紧张、价格上涨。如果这时候资本（投资）的回报率又在下降，经济就容易出现严重问题，爆发危机。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4566-4660", "createTime": 1752247455, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "17139892_81zixEkTp", "userVid": 17139892, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 17139892, "name": "🐳空白", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/hNWCQ9bibbzGwmx2pVUianIED6Zwibk51yk6F5N1gN0OWnvtnYGOaQgEta6yGveVxhVyLarFrjCg4w/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "🐳空白", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 24, "likes": [{"userVid": 17139892, "name": "🐳空白", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/hNWCQ9bibbzGwmx2pVUianIED6Zwibk51yk6F5N1gN0OWnvtnYGOaQgEta6yGveVxhVyLarFrjCg4w/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "🐳空白", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "先发优势，后发劣势", "reviewId": "17139892_81zixEkTp", "commentId": "17139892_81zixEkTp_c33340421_8bnLRCGUk", "userVid": 3334